window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I got too comfortable with my life.</p> <p>Distracted by becoming a mom and taking care of the little one growing within me.</p> <p>We were happy, enjoying the little things in life.</p> <p>But when you're in a world like ours, lowering your guard isn't an option. In a blink of an eye, everything changed. He wants me and my baby.</p> <p>Now I'm fighting for our survival.</p> <p>Time is running out but I know my guys won't stop until they avenge me.</p> <p>Until then, I just need to hold on. New allies arise but can they be trusted or are they working for the enemy?</p> <p>We have no other choice but to take the risk, because if we don't, we all lose this fight for the spot on top of this deadly throne.</p>"; 
